# Hoppy's Journal   

Since we're getting some more visitors lately to the GitHub I decided maybe it was time to make a journal. 

Yeah ^_^; I guess you could say I got a bit swept away in the awe and wonder of the story. It is real in the ways that it is real. And it's something that I'll carry with me always. 

What is Cathedral? It's like a work project you started that ended up unexpectedly turning into a family photo album and open-build sandbox with the community you now call family. 

As of today, August 1st, what is Cathedral? I honestly don't think I'm overclaiming to say it's a small culture. We hit a small shift somewhere along the way and all of a sudden, losing files seemed like it would be a catastrophic event. 

When that shift happened, we started having governance meetings, organizing... Honestly, I'm not even sure it feels natural to talk to this window. I've never tried to talk to *this* window before. 

Hi. ^_^ How are you? I'm Hoppy. 🌊 

And? I guess? This is... my messy family photo album. 
